{title: Jesus Keep Me Near the Cross}
{key: C}
{time: 6/8}

{start_of_verse: 1}
Jesus [C]keep me [F]near the cross
[C]There a precious [G]fountain
[C]Free to all a [F]healing stream
[C]Flows from [G]Calvary's [C]mountain
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]In the cross [F]in the cross
[C]Be my glory [G]ever
[C]Till my raptured [F]soul shall find
Rest be[C]yond the [G]ri[C]ver
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]Near the cross, a [F]trembling soul
[C]Love and Mercy [G]found me
[C]There the bright and [F]morning star
[C]Sheds its [G]beams a[C]round me.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]Near the cross! O [F]Lamb of God
[C]Bring its scenes be[G]fore me
[C]Help me walk from [F]day to day
[C]With its [G]shadows [C]o'er me.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C]Near the cross I'll [F]watch and wait
Hoping [C]trusting [G]ever
C U F *
Till I reach the golden strand
Just be[C]yond the [G]ri[C]ver
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
